---
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  Search / graph index. Fetched lazily by assets/js/extras.js the first time the
  command palette, the hero terminal or the knowledge graph needs it.
  Keys are short on purpose: t/tv title (en/vi), u url, d date, c category,
  g tags, e excerpt (en), ev excerpt (vi), x full text.
{%- endcomment -%}
[
{%- for p in site.posts -%}
  {
    "t": {{ p.title | jsonify }},
    "tv": {{ p.title_vi | default: p.title | jsonify }},
    "u": {{ p.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
    "d": {{ p.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d" | jsonify }},
    "c": {{ p.categories | first | default: "blog" | jsonify }},
    "g": {{ p.tags | jsonify }},
    "e": {{ p.excerpt | strip_html | strip_newlines | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }},
    "ev": {{ p.excerpt_vi | default: p.excerpt | strip_html | strip_newlines | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }},
    "x": {{ p.content | strip_html | strip_newlines | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }}
  }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor -%}
]
